her heroes  understand right away that this  is bad endeavor deku and bakugo  all try their best to get to gran torino  before shigaki can attack him  but they are too late shigaraki grabs  gran torino  and smashes him straight into the ground  as all of this is happening we see a  flashback to the moment when shigaraki's  grandmother  nana shimura decided to give up her son  shigaraki's father kotaro in order to  protect him from  all for one because nana was a known  enemy of japan's most dangerous criminal  at the time  she thought that if the villain found  out about her son he would hurt kotaro  in order to get to her so nana decided  to give him up  and erase all records of the fact that  she was his mother  she did this to protect him but kotaro  resented the fact that his mother  abandoned him for the rest of his life  and kotaro's resentment of pro-heroes  led to his abusive behavior towards  shigaraki which  ultimately led to shigaraki becoming a  villain so  even though nana had the best of  intentions and even though she only  wanted to protect her son  her actions indirectly led to shigaraki  becoming a villain  we also learned that in that moment when  nana gave up kotaro  a much younger gran torino was there and  he was watching the whole thing  from a distance afterwards nana and gran  torino had a very emotional moment  on a rooftop a moment in which the two  of them embraced as nana  sobbed about the difficult decision that  they had just made  in this moment i definitely got the vibe  that gran torino and anna  might be in a romantic relationship and  that gran torino might even be  shigaraki's grandfather however that was  just a vibe that i got  they could totally be just friends and  that might have been a hug from a friend  embracing and consoling his friend in a  difficult moment  so i don't want to make any crazy  assumptions here just wanted to share  how this whole scene  made me feel personally it would be  pretty crazy though if shigaki just  killed his own grandfather without even  realizing although let's face it this  wouldn't exactly be the first time  shigaki killed a family member  back in the present time we see the  aftermath of shigaraki smashing gran  torino into the ground  and we see that blood is flying  everywhere  this doesn't look good for gran torino  and deku absolutely loses it endeavour  warns deku not to rush out and attack  shigaraki  and obviously deku doesn't listen to any  of it because it's deku  what do you expect however shigaraki  doesn't wait for deku to get to him  shigaraki who now somehow seems a lot  faster than before  runs past deku and bakugou and it  appears that he is targeting  aizawa isabel is of course trying to  cancel out shigaraki's quirks from a  distance  and our boy racer head is already  looking pretty damn exhausted  after all of this time in fact manuel  and rocklock are helping him and  literally holding izawa up  as they are walking thankfully as  shigaraki approaches izawa ryukyu is  able to grab him  in her dragon form and just as she slows  him down for a second  deku sneaks up behind shigaraki and uses  black whip to restrain him further  deku and shigaraki struggle as shigaraki  attempts to break free  as this is happening endeavour screams  at deku to hold shigaraki in that exact  position  and endeavour prepares to muster up one  final epic attack  he hopes that he can finish shigaraki  off if he can just squeeze out  one more full power attack but from  everything that we've seen so far  it is unlikely that even this last great  effort from endeavor will be enough  to put chikaraki down for the count but  before endeavour can even attack  shigaraki manages to poke his arm out  through ryukyu's giant scaly hand  and in that moment we see that shigaraki  apparently has a quirk destroying bullet  in his possession and by the looks of it  shigaraki intends to use that bullet on  aizawa  in order to prevent him from erasing  shigaraki's quirks  interestingly enough the final panel of  this chapter  is none other than a shot of arie  looking happy and carefree  and this panel is likely there to remind  us about aries quirk rewind  and to drive home the full implications  of what shigaraki is about to do  we might even get something about aryan  media at the beginning of the next  chapter but we'll have to wait and see  wow this was definitely one crazy  chapter  not only is gran torino possibly dead  not only is gran torino  possibly shigaraki's secret grandfather  but aizawa may be about to have his  quirk erased  by shigaraki let's face it we all knew  that the heroes wouldn't  end this battle that easily and as  expected shigeraki now looks like he is  about to turn the tides of the battle  if he can really stop isabel from  erasing his quirks  then all bets are off so it makes sense  that he would try to make this his first  priority but will shigaraki succeed in  eliminating izawa as a threat  or will the heroes stop shigaraki before  he can reach  aizawa also is gran torino shigaraki's  secret grandfather  and more importantly did gran torino  just die  finally what do you think is going to  happen next is shiraki about to kill  someone else  please share your thoughts down in the  comments below if you enjoyed this video  and you want to see more boku no your  content on the channel please leave a  like  to let me know and if you happen to be  new to anime outbroad  or you just haven't subscribed make this  the video that you subscribe  and hit that notification bell to turn  on all  notifications you can also hit me up on  twitter  and instagram at anime uproar  i want to give a big thank you to all of  our anime uproar  patrons who make videos like this one  possible an extra special thank you to  alpha a disciple of lord twigo  himself and i can't forget are the one  tier patrons the ones who rise above all  other clans including ingrata alolan  adam the world  steelers acquired respect pate hef